  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252faether-treasure-reforging\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Prospector/badges/master/modrinth-badge-72h-padded.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"183\" height=\"72\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fen.wikipedia.org%252fwiki%252fAll_rights_reserved\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/assets license-All Rights Reserved-red.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"204\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/The-Aether-Team/Protect-Your-Moa/blob/1.19.4-develop/LICENSE.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/code license-LGPL v3.0-green.svg?style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"142\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=TheAetherTeam&type=patrons&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/118816101936267265.svg?label=discord&logoColor=FFFFFF&logo=discord&color=7289DA&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://twitter.com/DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/twitter-@DevAether-lightgrey?style=flat-square&logo=twitter&color=1DA1F2&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"143\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmastodon.gamedev.place%252f%2540DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/mastodon/follow/110581810287361848?domain=https://mastodon.gamedev.place/&style=flat-square&logo=mastodon&logoColor=white&label=mastodon&color=858AFA\" alt=\"Mastodon\" width=\"99\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbsky.app%252fprofile%252faether-mod.net\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/bluesky-@aether--mod--net-green?logo=cloud&logoSource=feather&style=flat-square&color=0085ff\" alt=\"\" width=\"179\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.threads.net%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/threads-devaether-green?logo=instagram-threads&style=flat-square&color=000000\" alt=\"\" width=\"133\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.facebook.com%252fAetherMod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/facebook-AetherMod-blue?logo=facebook&style=flat-square&color=1877F2&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"145\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/devaether-instagram?color=D50060&label=instagram&logo=instagram&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.tiktok.com%252f%2540devaether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/@devaether-tiktok?color=000000&label=tiktok&logo=tiktok&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"135\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@DevAether\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/youtube-@DevAether-blue?color=FF0000&label=youtube&logo=youtube&style=flat-square\" alt=\"\" width=\"151\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/theaetherteam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/twitch/status/theaetherteam?logo=twitch&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"103\" height=\"20\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.reddit.com%252fr%252fTheAether%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/TheAether-reddit?color=FF4500&label=reddit&logo=reddit&style=flat-square&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\" width=\"127\" height=\"20\"></a>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faether.wiki.gg%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://custom-icon-badges.demolab.com/badge/wiki.gg-aether-green?logo=wikigg&style=flat-square&color=FF1980\" alt=\"\" width=\"111\" height=\"20\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>🔨 關於此附加包 🔨<br></strong></span></h2>\n<p>「寶藏重塑」附加包允許將<strong>多餘的地牢戰利品</strong>回收並製成不同的裝備。此功能透過使用全新的<strong>鍛造圖樣</strong>，搭配熔煉特定裝備後獲得的<strong>獨特素材</strong>來實現。</p>\n<p>海神裝備可拆解為<strong>海神網格</strong>，女武神裝備可拆解為<strong>女武神錠</strong>，鳳凰裝備可拆解為<strong>鳳凰錠</strong>。你甚至可以將太陽祭壇拆解為<strong>鳳凰碎片</strong>，這些碎片可以搭配黑曜石重新鍛造成鳳凰錠，或用於重新點燃黑曜石盔甲。女武神錠與鳳凰錠甚至能進一步製作成全新的壓縮方塊。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/6371b821b24e43cf2fbc18f9405edef2bfe87e92/images/treasureReforging0.png\" width=\"1588\" height=\"854\"></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>☁️ 來自天堂團隊的更多作品 ☁️</strong></span></h2>\n<p>如果您對本附加包有任何疑問，或只是對天堂團隊開發的其他專案感興趣，歡迎加入天堂計畫的 Discord 伺服器！我們友善的工作人員與熱情的社群將讓您有賓至如歸的感覺！</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/aethermod\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>您也可以透過在 Patreon 上贊助來支持天堂團隊！每一筆贊助款項都將直接投入開發，讓我們能持續從事最熱愛的事業。<a href=\"https://patreon.com/TheAetherTeam\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/The-Aether-Team/.github/main/images/image3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"434\" height=\"102\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
